          "explanation": "Rand's thesis is that capitalism's friends defended it as efficient while accepting an ethics of self-sacrifice that condemns self-interest. That leaves the system looking productive but immoral, so critics always hold the moral high ground. She did not think capitalism was failing economically, and she believed businessmen were too apologetic about profit, not too proud of it.",
