          "explanation": "Rand limits government to protecting individual rights, which means police, courts, and national defense -- the retaliatory use of force against those who initiate it. Public schools, minimum wages, and central banking all involve the state directing economic life, which she called a breach of the separation of state and economics. Many free-market economists accept some of those functions; Rand did not.",
